ChowRing -- Computes the Chow ring of a product of projective spaces m projective spaces given the coordinate ring
******************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        ChowRing R
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, the graded coordinate ring of the
        product of projective spaces \PP^{n_1}\times \cdots \times \PP^{n_m}
  * Outputs:
      * a *note quotient ring: (Macaulay2Doc)QuotientRing,, the Chow ring
        A=\ZZ[h_1,...,h_m]/(h_1^{n_1+1},...,h_m^{n_m+1}) of a product of
        projective spaces \PP^{n_1}\times \cdots \times\PP^{n_m}

Description
===========

This method computes the Chow ring
A=\ZZ[h_1,...,h_m]/(h_1^{n_1+1},...,h_m^{n_m+1}) of a product of projective
spaces \PP^{n_1}\times \cdots \times\PP^{n_m}. It is needed for input into the
methods *note Segre: Segre,, *note Chern: Chern, and *note CSM: CSM, to ensure
that these methods return results in the same ring. We give an example of the
use of this method to work with elements of the Chow ring of \PP^3x\PP^4.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=MultiProjCoordRing({3,4})                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A=ChowRing(R)                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = A                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I=ideal(random({1,0},R));                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : K=ideal(random({1,1},R));                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : c=Chern(A,I)                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|        3 4      3 3      2 4      3 2      2 3       4      3        2 2    |
|o5 = 15h h  + 30h h  + 15h h  + 30h h  + 30h h  + 5h h  + 15h h  + 30h h  +  |
|        1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2     1 2      1 2      1 2    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|          3     3      2          2     2                                    |
|     10h h  + 3h  + 15h h  + 10h h  + 3h  + 5h h  + h                        |
|        1 2     1      1 2      1 2     1     1 2    1                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : s=Segre(A,K)                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|        3 4      3 3      2 4      3 2      2 3       4     3       2 2      |
|o6 = 35h h  - 20h h  - 15h h  + 10h h  + 10h h  + 5h h  - 4h h  - 6h h  -    |
|        1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2     1 2     1 2     1 2      |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         3    4    3     2         2    3    2            2                  |
|     4h h  - h  + h  + 3h h  + 3h h  + h  - h  - 2h h  - h  + h  + h         |
|       1 2    2    1     1 2     1 2    2    1     1 2    2    1    2        |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : s-c                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|        3 4      3 3      2 4      3 2      2 3      3        2 2        3   |
|o7 = 20h h  - 50h h  - 30h h  - 20h h  - 20h h  - 19h h  - 36h h  - 14h h  - |
|        1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      4     3      2         2    3     2            2                       |
|     h  - 2h  - 12h h  - 7h h  + h  - 4h  - 7h h  - h  + h                   |
|      2     1      1 2     1 2    2     1     1 2    2    2                  |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : s*c                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|        3 4      3 3      2 4      3 2      2 3       4      3        2 2    |
|o8 = 12h h  + 21h h  + 12h h  + 20h h  + 19h h  + 4h h  + 10h h  + 15h h  +  |
|        1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2      1 2     1 2      1 2      1 2    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         3     3     2         2    2                                        |
|     6h h  + 2h  + 6h h  + 4h h  + h  + h h                                  |
|       1 2     1     1 2     1 2    1    1 2                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

We may also specify the variable to be used for the Chow ring.

+----------------------------+
|i9 : A2=ChowRing(R,symbol v)|
|                            |
|o9 = A2                     |
|                            |
|o9 : QuotientRing           |
+----------------------------+
|i10 : describe A2           |
|                            |
|      ZZ[v ..v ]            |
|          1   2             |
|o10 = ----------            |
|         4   5              |
|       (v , v )             |
|         1   2              |
+----------------------------+

